value.REFLECTION_MODE.0=Sky only
value.REFLECTION_MODE.1=Reference
value.REFLECTION_MODE.2=High
option.SKY_AMBIENT=Diffuse ambient brightness
option.SKY_AMBIENT.comment=Diffuse skylight brightness. Expanded range reaches very dark and deliberately bright looks; source default1.40.
option.ambientOcclusionLevel=Corner shading
option.ambientOcclusionLevel.comment=Vanilla corner AO, default and maximum 1.00; does not raise exposure.
option.WHITE_BALANCE=Subtle white balance
option.WHITE_BALANCE.comment=Zero preserves neutral foreground colour.
option.SURFACE_SATURATION=Surface saturation
option.SURFACE_SATURATION.comment=1.00 preserves vanilla saturation. Lighting, absorption and bloom still affect the final image.
option.SURFACE_DAMPNESS=Surface dampness
option.SURFACE_DAMPNESS.comment=Matte moisture absorption follows porosity, face drainage, sky exposure, humidity and rain. No environmental reflections, glossy film, corner outlines or random noise.
value.SURFACE_DAMPNESS.0.00=Dry
value.SURFACE_DAMPNESS.0.35=Subtle
value.SURFACE_DAMPNESS.0.65=Moderate
value.SURFACE_DAMPNESS.1.00=Damp (default)
value.SURFACE_DAMPNESS.1.35=Strong
value.SURFACE_DAMPNESS.1.70=Very strong
value.SURFACE_DAMPNESS.2.00=Maximum
option.LAMP_LEVEL=Lantern and block light
option.LAMP_LEVEL.comment=Diffuse local brightness and emissive pixel interiors, with adjustable subtle bloom.
option.LAMP_HEAT=Local light warmth
option.LAMP_HEAT.comment=A restrained amber bias where block lighting dominates.
option.CLOUD_AMOUNT=Overcast coverage
option.CLOUD_AMOUNT.comment=Density/coverage strength of the current vanilla cloud footprint. Zero hides the lower layer; high clouds are independent. The footprint is preserved at every nonzero value.
option.CLOUD_SPAN=Cloud band size
option.CLOUD_SPAN.comment=Scale of the current vanilla cloud footprint. Default 240 gives 12-block texture cells; changing scale preserves its connected shapes.
option.CLOUD_DISTORTION=Cloud shape irregularity
option.CLOUD_DISTORTION.comment=Gentle vertical relief within connected clouds. Never warps or erodes the vanilla horizontal footprint.
option.CLOUD_RELIEF=Cloud shade depth
option.CLOUD_RELIEF.comment=Self-shadowing and smooth light/dark depth within the simple connected cloud forms.
option.CLOUD_DRIFT=Slow cloud drift
option.CLOUD_DRIFT.comment=Zero freezes the world-anchored ceiling.
option.CLOUD_LAYERS=Cloud sampling
option.CLOUD_LAYERS.comment=Cloud shape, integration and self-shadow sampling. High is the reference-quality default; lower values trade detail for speed.
option.MIST_AMOUNT=Valley mist density
option.MIST_AMOUNT.comment=Outdoor mist opacity. Cave surfaces without skylight reject valley mist.
option.MIST_Y=Lower mist altitude
option.MIST_Y.comment=World Y of the principal pale horizontal mist layer.
option.MIST_THICKNESS=Mist layer thickness
option.MIST_THICKNESS.comment=Height/depth of drifting3D fog pockets and valley layers, adjustable from thin banks to deep mist.
option.MIST_CLEAR=Clear foreground range
option.MIST_CLEAR.comment=Clear range before volumetric fog begins. Default24blocks lets nearby pockets show depth while the immediate foreground remains clear.
option.MIST_DETAIL=Mist spatial variation
option.MIST_DETAIL.comment=Sampling detail for broad horizontal density patches.
option.REFLECT_LEVEL=Water reflection amount
option.REFLECT_LEVEL.comment=Scales above-water angle-dependent dielectric reflection. 1.00 uses physical Fresnel. The underwater interface remains transparent without a reflection overlay.
option.REFLECTION_MODE=Scenery reflection quality
option.REFLECTION_MODE.comment=Sky fallback,32-step scenery tracing, or96-step high-quality tracing with precise hits. Hidden geometry remains a screen-space limitation.
option.REFLECT_RANGE=Scenery trace distance
option.REFLECT_RANGE.comment=Misses fade to the procedural sky, including at screen borders.
option.WATER_VISIBILITY=Water clarity
option.WATER_VISIBILITY.comment=1.70 is the default. Higher values reduce optical extinction. Actual visibility also responds to biome sediment, rain runoff and shelter.
option.WATER_EXTINCTION=Depth absorption
option.WATER_EXTINCTION.comment=Absorption and sediment scattering along the actual water segment. Underwater fog stops at the visible exit; air beyond it adds no water absorption.
option.RIPPLE_HEIGHT=Ripple strength
option.RIPPLE_HEIGHT.comment=Shading normal amplitude. Water geometry remains vanilla.
option.RIPPLE_SIZE=Ripple spacing
option.RIPPLE_SIZE.comment=Scale of the four unequal spectral wave components.
option.RIPPLE_RATE=Ripple speed
option.RIPPLE_RATE.comment=Zero freezes all surface movement.
option.FACE_SHADING=Combined face contrast
option.FACE_SHADING.comment=Master strength for vanilla and realistic components. Both new component multipliers at 1 reproduce the previous combined look.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Subtle bloom
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=Visible restrained light halos. Emissive masking protects ordinary entities and white blocks from glowing.
option.CLOUD_ALTITUDE=Physical cloud altitude
option.CLOUD_ALTITUDE.comment=World height of the cloud layer centre. Fly below, through and above it.
option.CLOUD_THICKNESS=Physical cloud thickness
option.CLOUD_THICKNESS.comment=Vertical thickness in blocks. Default 12 keeps connected vanilla shapes low and simple; 4 approaches vanilla slab proportions. Existing thicker values remain available.
option.SKY_LEAK=Light through the sky
option.SKY_LEAK.comment=Broad daylight glow through the cloud ceiling. Sun visibility separately controls the haze-softened solar core.
option.WET_SHEEN=Wet film and retention
option.WET_SHEEN.comment=Rain-driven view-dependent sheen on exposed absorbent materials, plus existing sheltered matte retention. Zero disables both. Clear/dry and nonporous materials do not gain a glossy coat.
option.BLOOM_RADIUS=Bloom radius
option.BLOOM_RADIUS.comment=Restrained halo width, stable relative to image height. Bloom strength remains a separate control.
option.SUN_VISIBILITY=Sun through overcast
option.SUN_VISIBILITY.comment=Brightness of the polished blocky sun behind clouds. Zero hides its textured core; broad sky haze remains.
option.FACE_BLEND=Face shading blend
option.FACE_BLEND.comment=Overall blend from unshaded faces to the two independent lighting components. Zero bypasses both.
option.GROUND_WARMTH=Sun-warmed ground
option.GROUND_WARMTH.comment=Golden sunlight only on outward sun-facing block faces, weighted by skylight and nearby visible occluders. No brown tint on all sides.
option.WATER_DISTORTION=Above-water refraction distortion
option.WATER_DISTORTION.comment=Controls the ripple distortion seen through water from above. Underwater uses a straight-through view without Snell refraction; Ripple height adjusts the shared surface shape.
option.CIRRUS_AMOUNT=High cloud coverage
option.CIRRUS_AMOUNT.comment=Coverage/strength of the independent high cloud veil. Its separate density control makes the layer visible without changing lower clouds. Zero hides the upper layer.
option.CIRRUS_ALTITUDE=High cloud altitude
option.CIRRUS_ALTITUDE.comment=World altitude of the upper wispy cloud layer.

screen.WATER=Water
screen.REFLECTIONS=Reflections
