screen.ATMOSPHERE=Atmosphere
screen.CLOUDS=Clouds
screen.SUN=Sun and moon
screen.FOG=Fog
screen.MATERIALS=Materials and dampness
screen.POST=Colour and bloom
screen.PERFORMANCE=Performance
option.CLOUD_STYLE=Cloud style
option.CLOUD_STYLE.comment=Stratus extrudes the running game's current cloud texture with simple forms and soft shading. Vanilla uses actual fancy cloud geometry. Off hides both.
value.CLOUD_STYLE.0=Stratus volumetric
value.CLOUD_STYLE.1=Vanilla fancy
value.CLOUD_STYLE.2=Off
option.SUN_STYLE=Sun and moon style
option.SUN_STYLE.comment=Polished mode keeps Minecraft's square sun and adds independently adjustable core brightness and local halo. Vanilla mode retains native textured sun and moon.
value.SUN_STYLE.0=Polished vanilla sun
value.SUN_STYLE.1=Vanilla textures
option.BIOME_WATER=Environment-aware water
option.BIOME_WATER.comment=Vanilla biome tint plus smoothed sediment, humidity, temperature, rain runoff and local cave lighting. These are visual approximations, not measured sediment data.
value.BIOME_WATER.0=Off
value.BIOME_WATER.1=On
option.WATER_TURBIDITY=Suspended sediment
option.WATER_TURBIDITY.comment=Scattering from suspended particles. Swamps and rainy rivers carry more sediment; sheltered cave water rejects rain runoff.

screen.REFRACTION=Refraction
option.REFRACTION_QUALITY=Refraction quality
option.REFRACTION_QUALITY.comment=Higher levels improve shoreline protection above water and the search for terrain viewed through the surface from underwater. Fast retains the original above-water depth guard.
value.REFRACTION_QUALITY.0=Fast
value.REFRACTION_QUALITY.1=Balanced
value.REFRACTION_QUALITY.2=High
option.CLOUD_DENSITY=Cloud optical thickness
option.CLOUD_DENSITY.comment=Optical density of the simple cloud volumes. Lower-layer shapes come from the active vanilla/resource-pack cloud texture.
option.CLOUD_DETAIL=Cloud gradient detail
option.CLOUD_DETAIL.comment=Broad smooth density gradients within simple connected clouds. Fine pores and noisy billows have been removed.
option.MIST_SCALE=Fog pocket size
option.MIST_SCALE.comment=World-space size of drifting3D fog banks. Smaller values produce more local pockets; larger values broad valley structures.
option.MIST_BREAKUP=Fog spatial variation
option.MIST_BREAKUP.comment=Zero makes smooth fog; higher values create distinct connected pockets and gaps. Shape remains anchored in3D world space.
option.MIST_LIGHT=Fog light scattering
option.MIST_LIGHT.comment=Directional sunlight scattered by fog, with internal extinction. Independent of fog density.
option.WET_DARKENING=Material absorption darkening
option.WET_DARKENING.comment=Darkening strength on absorbent soil, timber, stone, fabric and masonry. Metals/glazed surfaces have no pore darkening. Wet sheen is separate.

option.EXPOSURE=Overall exposure
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Camera brightness in stops, affecting terrain, sky, water and bloom together. +1 doubles scene light; HUD is unchanged.

option.ATMOSPHERE_QUALITY=Atmosphere quality
option.ATMOSPHERE_QUALITY.comment=Cloud and fog image quality, independent of water reflections. Balanced retains volume detail at lower rendering cost.
value.ATMOSPHERE_QUALITY.0=Fast
value.ATMOSPHERE_QUALITY.1=Balanced
value.ATMOSPHERE_QUALITY.2=High

option.WATER_RENDER_QUALITY=Water render quality
option.WATER_RENDER_QUALITY.comment=Resolution of water surface optics. Balanced uses half resolution with depth and normal aware reconstruction. Opaque terrain and submerged blocks seen directly remain full resolution.
value.WATER_RENDER_QUALITY.0=Fast
value.WATER_RENDER_QUALITY.1=Balanced
value.WATER_RENDER_QUALITY.2=Full resolution


option.VANILLA_FACE_CONTRAST=Vanilla face component
option.VANILLA_FACE_CONTRAST.comment=Independent multiplier for fixed vanilla axis contrast. 0 removes it; 1 retains the previous contribution. Existing master contrast/blend remain.
option.REALISTIC_FACE_CONTRAST=Realistic face component
option.REALISTIC_FACE_CONTRAST.comment=Independent multiplier for world-space sun, sky and ground contrast. 0 removes it; 1 retains the previous contribution. Exposure/rain/night still apply.
option.SUN_CORE_BRIGHTNESS=Polished sun brightness
option.SUN_CORE_BRIGHTNESS.comment=HDR brightness of the blocky textured core in polished mode. 2.80 reproduces the previous core; vanilla mode is unaffected.
option.SUN_HALO_STRENGTH=Sun-local halo strength
option.SUN_HALO_STRENGTH.comment=Additional light scatter around the polished sun only. 0 disables it without altering the core or global bloom.
option.SUN_HALO_RADIUS=Sun-local halo radius
option.SUN_HALO_RADIUS.comment=Angular spread of the polished sun's smoothly falling halo. Does not resize the blocky core or brighten unrelated objects.
option.CIRRUS_DENSITY=High cloud density
option.CIRRUS_DENSITY.comment=Optical density of the independent high cloud layer. 0 hides it; coverage/altitude and lower-cloud controls remain independent.
